lan-route-fixer (2.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix GUI/manual repair reporting exit code 64 by passing helper batch JSON
    as an argument instead of relying on pkexec stdin forwarding.
  * Fix helper route command so it no longer invokes the ip binary twice.
  * Include the ip error message when a privileged route replacement fails.

